  "notes": "Roster from /overview/board-members/: 50 members, 6 officers (three Secretaries listed). Multi-name chair fields are co-chairs joined with semicolons; committee chairs come from the role annotations on the board-members page plus the Arts/Budget/Communications committee pages (which also list committee rosters; short name variants like Gayle Baron, Michele Birnbaum, Lori Bores kept verbatim in committee arrays). Land Use is described as a committee of the whole. Nav also lists a Full Board page (a meeting, not a committee) and an Ad-Hoc Committees and Task Forces section of mostly archival items (Census, Charter Revision, CUNY-MSK, 91st Street De-mapping, Cornell Tech, Second Avenue Subway task forces etc.) not extracted as current committees. Public members and staff liaisons excluded."
